    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "One thing this chord is not: "
        },
        {
          "text": "G7#5",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " is a four-note chord, and it's out of scope here. This pathway's "
        },
        {
          "text": "G+",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " is three notes — "
        },
        {
          "text": "G",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "text": "B",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "text": "D#",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": ". The augmented triad here is a chord you pass through, not one you land on."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Keep rotating that same shape up the neck, four frets at a time, and something strange happens to its name — "
        },
        {
          "text": "the shape with no root of its own",
